  ],
  "description": "EH-460D note A MN3007 variant with the original 27 kΩ wet mix, RC4558 emphasis, and PNP/NPN low-pass followers. Depth switches the 2.7 kΩ load. The original LM358 integrator uses a linear closed-loop approximation with a startup seed. The Schmitt stage uses a TL022 proxy and a small stability capacitor. The CD4047 uses a calibrated control-to-period approximation and a clocked 1024-stage model. Combined BBD outputs and omitted electronic bypass, indicator and clock feedthrough.",
